olving heavy/OOG and general freight air freight</li><li>Preparing and calculating air freight quotes and customized pricing solutions in close collaboration with our global offices</li><li>Acting as the central point of contact for tenders with air freight scopes and ensuring complete, competitive and concise air freight pricing</li><li>Developing and maintaining competitive buy and sell rates and ensuring transparent and traceable calculations</li><li>Monitoring and analyzing market, capacity, and pricing trends</li><li>Negotiating terms with airlines, GSAs/partners, and other service providers</li><li>Handling ad-hoc inquiries and smaller-scope tenders for air freight export and import</li><li>Supporting the sales team in developing customer-specific pricing strategies</li><li>Following up on submitted quotes</li><li>Collaborating with our global offices in obtaining their local air freight costs for tenders</li><li>Assisting in the development and implementation of pricing strategies for specific trade lanes, routes, or products</li><li>Handing over secured shipments to the relevant operational departments</li><li>Conducting price analysis for air freight export and import as part of tenders and providing pricing guidance to the offices</li><li>Developing and maintaining relationships to airlines and air freight handling partners</li><li>Developing strategies to optimize revenue</li></ul></p><br><strong>Your profile</strong><p><ul><li>Ideally, 5+ years professional experience in the field </li><li>Completed vocational training or retraining as a Freight Forwarding and Logistics Services Specialist, Logistics Bachelor Degree or similar education</li><li>Professional experience in air freight, freight forwarding, pricing, or tender management</li><li>Solid knowledge of the international air freight market</li><li>Experience working with airline rates and freight calculations</li><li>Good communication skills and a collaborative approach to teamwork</li><li>Structu