itnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/thermengruppe-josef-wund/senior-controller-fpa-manager-munchen-203243","tags":["Controlling","Finance","kpi","Controller","Analysis","Reportings"],"job_types":["Experienced","Permanent","Full time"],"location":"München","created_at":1791144575},{"slug":"senior-product-manager-isr-defence-intelligence-liveeo-gmbh-berlin-office-hybrid-376706","company_name":"LiveEO GmbH","title":"Senior Product Manager (ISR) Defence & Intelligence (f/m/x)","description":"<br><strong>Build the Market Leader in Satellite Analytics with us at LiveEO</strong><p><p style="margin:0.75rem 0px 0px;padding:0px;font:400 16px/1.714 'Atlassian Sans', 'ui-sans-serif', '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;color:rgb(41,42,46);text-align:left;text-transform:none;">We are looking for a Senior Product Manager (<span><span><span>ISR</span></span></span>) (f/m/x) to own the product and delivery side of LiveEO's defence and intelligence business. Sektion 4 builds AI-based <span>ISR</span> capabilities for German and allied defence and intelligence customers: object and change detection in very high resolution satellite imagery, 3D terrain products derived from stereo imagery, and the analytics that turn imagery into decisions. You will run our customer-facing defence products end to end from a product management perspective including analytical products as well as end user applications. You will also build the roadmap that connects different customer timelines, our concept of operations and the actual maturity of our technical components into one plan that engineering and sales both work from. This role exists because our LiveEO engineers build world class AI models and your work will help to bring them into operations and roll them out to many more end users. We need someone who can say how an analyst does the job, write requirements a military user would recognise, and hold the line on what we ship.</p><p style="margin:0.75rem 0px 0px;padding:0px;font:400 16px/1.714 'Atlassian Sans', 'ui-sans-serif', '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;color:rgb(41,42,46);text-align:left;text-transform:none;">LiveEO is a dynamic team that thrives on big challenges and fast learning cycles. We move quickly, stay curious, and genuinely enjoy building together. We are on a mission to break the "curse of Earth Observation": turning incredible satellite data into reliable, actionable decisions that people can trust and use in real operations on scale. </p><p style="margin:0.75rem 0px 0px;padding:0px;font:400 16px/1.714 'Atlassian Sans', 'ui-sans-serif', '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;color:rgb(41,42,46);text-align:left;text-transform:none;">You will be part of Sektion 4, LiveEO's government-solutions product team. Sektion 4 owns its roadmap and delivers funded R&amp;D projects and defence engagements end-to-end, from research through to production, and sets its own technical direction. You will work day to day with the team's ML engineergs, full-stack engineers and geospatial data egineers, and across LiveEO with sales, pre-sales and the teams building the Twinspector satellite programme. Externally you are in front of military and agency users, partners and integrators, in workshops, requirement sessions and user tests.</p><br><span style="color:rgb(41,42,46);font-family:'Atlassian Sans', 'ui-sans-serif', '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-align:left;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);display:inline;"><strong style="color:rgb(41,42,46);font-family:'Atlassian Sans', 'ui-sans-serif', '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal