ica Neue', sans-serif;"><strong>Be the <span>ISR</span> authority in the team:</strong> bring operational depth on the intelligence cycle, collection and tasking, and imagery exploitation. Be the person engineering asks how an analyst would really use this, and the person sales asks what we can credibly claim.</p></li><li style="margin-top:4px;"><p style="margin:0px;padding:0px;font:400 16px/1.714 'Atlassian Sans', 'ui-sans-serif', '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;"><strong>Work with users and customers:</strong> run workshops and user sessions, gather and structure feedback, demonstrate the product, and support bids and proposals with operational substance.</p></li></ul></p><br><strong>Your profile</strong><p><ul style="margin:10px 0px 0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 24px;list-style-type:disc;color:rgb(41,42,46);font-family:'Atlassian Sans', 'ui-sans-serif', '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-align:left;text-transform:none;"><li><p style="margin:0px;padding:0px;font:400 16px/1.714 'Atlassian Sans', 'ui-sans-serif', '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;">Professional <span>ISR</span>, <span><span><span>GEOINT</span></span></span> or <span><span><span>IMINT</span></span></span> background: Bundeswehr, the intelligence community, defence procurement, or an <span>ISR</span> role in industry.</p></li><li style="margin-top:4px;"><p style="margin:0px;padding:0px;font:400 16px/1.714 'Atlassian Sans', 'ui-sans-serif', '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;">Real operational fluency in the intelligence cycle, collection and tasking, and how imagery products are produced and consumed at a staff.</p></li><li style="margin-top:4px;"><p style="margin:0px;padding:0px;font:400 16px/1.714 'Atlassian Sans', 'ui-sans-serif', '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Ub