&lt;p&gt;#LI-DD1&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/zetaglobal/lead-compute-platform-engineer-berlin-435366","tags":["Engineering"],"job_types":[],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1791125720},{"slug":"product-designer-physical-products-ai-home-decor-brand-100-remote-part-fulltime-marktbreit-415474","company_name":"Time to hire","title":"Product Designer (m/f/d)- Physical Products & AI - home decor brand - 100% remote - part-/fulltime","description":"<p><strong>For my client, an established direct-to-consumer home decor brand, I’m looking for a talented Product Designer to join the team on a long-term basis.</strong></p>
<p>The company creates distinctive wooden home decor for customers primarily in the US, with a strong focus on wall art alongside selected freestanding pieces.</p>
<p>We’re looking for someone who combines a strong design eye with commercial thinking and hands-on AI skills — someone who can turn ideas and market insights into products customers genuinely want to buy.</p>
<h2>Tasks</h2>
<p>Your main responsibility will be to <strong>develop new, sellable physical products from idea to launch</strong>.</p>
<p>You’ll identify promising product opportunities through a mix of market and competitor research, emerging trends, existing bestsellers and your own creative ideas.</p>
<p>From there, you’ll take concepts through the full development process:</p>
<ul>
<li>Create and visualize new product concepts using AI image-generation tools</li>
<li>Refine ideas into commercially viable product directions</li>
<li>Collaborate with CAD designers to translate concepts into manufacturable designs</li>
<li>Work with suppliers and factories throughout sampling and development</li>
<li>Coordinate with the content and advertising teams to prepare products for launch</li>
<li>Manage several product concepts and development projects in parallel</li>
</ul>
<h2>Requirements</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Hands-on experience with AI image generation</strong>, using tools such as Nano Banana, Adobe Firefly, Flux or similar</li>
<li><strong>Experience designing physical products</strong> — not solely graphic, digital or UX/UI design</li>
<li><strong>A strong eye for aesthetics, form and commercial product design</strong>, demonstrated through a portfolio</li>
<li>Highly organized, reliable and comfortable managing multiple projects simultaneously</li>
<li>Fluent English</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Strong Plus</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Experience in <strong>home decor, furniture, interiors or lifestyle products</strong></li>
<li>A background working with <strong>wood, handcrafted products or similar materials</strong></li>
<li>A strong understanding of <strong>US home decor trends and customer preferences</strong></li>
<li>Experience collaborating with <strong>factories, manufacturers or suppliers</strong>, including product sampling and iterations</li>
</ul>
<h2>Benefits</h2>
<p>What You Can Expect</p>
<ul>
<li>🌍 <strong>100% remote – work from anywhere</strong></li>
<li>⏰ <strong>Flexible setup – part-time or full-time both possible</strong></li>
<li>🚀 <strong>High level of ownership</strong> over new products from the earliest idea through launch</li>
<li>🎨 <strong>Creative freedom</strong> to explore trends, concepts and entirely new product directions</li>
<li>🤖 <strong>AI-first product development environment</strong>, with modern tools integrated into the creative process</li>
<li>📈 <strong>Steep learning curve</strong> across product development, eCommerce and performance-driven product launches</li>
<li>🤝 <strong>International, entrepreneurial team</strong> with fast decision-making and close collaboration</li>
<li>📦 <strong>Direct exposure to the full product lifecycle</strong>, from concept and sampling to content, advertising and launch</li>
<li>🔄 <strong>Long-term collaboration</strong> with consistent opportunities to develop and launch new products</li>
<li>🚀 <strong>Start as soon as possible</strong></li>
</ul>
<p>If you’re a product designer who enjoys combining creativity, AI, commercial thinking and hands-on physical product development, I’d be happy to hear from you.</p>
<p><strong>Please apply with your CV, portfolio and a few examples of products or concepts you’ve personally developed.</strong></p>
