&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://qz.com/work/2053446/the-best-companies-for-working-from-home/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Quartz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; ranked us the #1 best company for remote workers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Account Executive UK&amp;amp;I&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Products &amp;amp; Resources Sectors&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Workato&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Workato delivers the enterprise infrastructure for the agentic era, redefining iPaaS and unifying data, applications, processes, and AI into a single, governed platform. Workato serves as both the &lt;strong&gt;control plane&lt;/strong&gt; and the &lt;strong&gt;action (execution) plane&lt;/strong&gt; for agentic use cases — governing how AI agents are authorized, orchestrated, and monitored while reliably executing the work they trigger across every connected system. A visionary in Enterprise MCP and trusted by 50% of the Fortune 500, Workato&#39;s cloud-native architecture connects every application, data source, and process to power real-time orchestration at scale. With enterprise-grade security and continuous innovation at its core, Workato gives organizations a trusted foundation to deploy agents with confidence — setting the policies and guardrails in the control plane and carrying out actions in the execution plane to operationalize AI across the business. To learn more, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.workato.com&quot;&gt;www.workato.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ultimately, Workato believes in fostering a &lt;strong&gt;flexible, trust-oriented culture that empowers everyone to take full ownership of their roles&lt;/strong&gt;. We are passionate by &lt;strong&gt;innovation &lt;/strong&gt;and looking for&lt;strong&gt; team players &lt;/strong&gt;who want to thoughtfully build our company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;But, we also believe in &lt;strong&gt;balancing productivity with self-care&lt;/strong&gt;. That’s why we offer all of our employees a vibrant and dynamic work environment &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.workato.com/careers&quot;&gt;along with a multitude of benefits&lt;/a&gt; they can enjoy inside and outside of their work lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds right up your alley, please submit an application. We look forward to getting to know you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Also, feel free to check out why:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.businessinsider.com/47-enterprise-startups-to-bet-your-career-on-in-2020-2019-12&quot;&gt;Business Insider&lt;/a&gt; named us an “enterprise startup to bet your career on”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.forbes.com/cloud100/#a57477b5f941&quot;&gt;Forbes’ Cloud 100&lt;/a&gt; recognized us as one of the top 100 private cloud companies in the world&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www2.deloitte.com/us/en/pages/technology-media-and-telecommunications/articles/fast500-winners.html&quot;&gt;Deloitte Tech Fast 500&lt;/a&gt; ranked us as the 17th fastest growing tech company in the Bay Area, and 96th in North America&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://qz.com/work/2053446/the-best-companies-for-working-from-home/&quot;&gt;Quartz&lt;/a&gt; ranked us the #1 best company for remote workers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Workato is on an extraordinary growth trajectory — and we&#39;re looking for&lt;strong&gt; Account Executives &lt;/strong&gt;ready to grow with us. As we continue to scale rapidly across the Nordic region, we&#39;re seeking an entrepreneurial company builder who thrives in dynamic environments and knows how to turn ambition into results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t a role for someone who follows a playbook. It&#39;s for someone who &lt;em&gt;writes&lt;/em&gt; one. You&#39;ll have the empowerment to shape strategy, build from the ground up, and make a real impact in one of the most exciting chapters of our journey. If you have a builder&#39;s mindset, a flexible approach to opportunities, and the hunger to be part of something memorable — this is your moment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications / Experience / Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-5 Years of experience in Enterprise New Business B2B sales, with a proven track record in enterprise SaaS or technology sales - ideally with some prior experience in integration, automation and/or workflow applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and executing outbound prospecting campaigns alongside marketing, SDR, partner and pre-sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked successfully with business partners and know how to build strong lasting relationships with our SI &amp;amp; VAR ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate tenacity, grit, and resilience when faced with adverse conditions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience handling and owning relationships with customers at CTO, CIO, Enterprise Architect whilst also engaging with business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable track record of consistently meeting or exceeding targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills / Personal Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an enthusiastic, energetic team player who is comfortable working in a fast-paced and evolving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are known for your strong work ethic and hunter mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You desire to build something new that can change the world, versus fitting neatly into a large company with an established static playbook&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a competitor with a thirst for success and a can-do attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy problem solving and can demonstrate an ability to develop creative ideas to address new opportunities or challenges you face&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be naturally good at managing your time and balancing a number of conflicting priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have a strong morale compass and apply your values to the way we conduct business with new prospects and existing clients&lt;/li&gt;
