:1.5em">• Advise CFOs and their leadership teams on transformation priorities and approach.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• Lead and manage finance transformation workstreams across process, data and technology.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• Design future-state finance operating models tailored to client context.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• Redesign core finance processes including R2R, P2P, O2C and FP&amp;A.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• Implement cloud-based ERP and EPM platforms, automation tools, data platforms and analytics solutions.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• Translate business requirements into practical ERP/EPM solutions and integrate technology into clients’ ecosystems.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• Drive adoption of transformation initiatives so the changes stick after we leave.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• Run executive workshops and lead steering committee updates.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• Ensure delivery on time, on budget and within scope.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• Lead, coach and develop team members.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• Contribute to go-to-market activities, proposal writing and pitch presentations.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• Support thought leadership on EPM trends and tools.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you'll bring</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">6+ years of experience in finance transformation including 2+ years in a consulting or advisory environment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Track record of delivering high-impact tech-enabled Finance Transformation programmes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience implementing ERP, EPM, analytics tools and automation platforms.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in process re-engineering and operating model design.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Finance/Accounting qualification including ACA/ACCA/CIMA/CPA</p></li>