ccess Partner, Enterprise (Paris)</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">As a Customer Success Partner at CreatorIQ, you will serve as a strategic advisor to a portfolio of high-level enterprise customers, helping them achieve meaningful business outcomes through their creator marketing programs. You’ll work closely with customers to understand their goals and align them with CreatorIQ’s platform capabilities, driving long-term adoption, value realization, and program success.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll build trusted, multi-threaded relationships with key stakeholders—both virtually and in person—and serve as a proactive partner throughout the customer lifecycle. Customer Success Partners are experts in the CreatorIQ platform, fluent in creator and influencer marketing strategy, and passionate about delivering measurable business impact.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will own the health and retention of your portfolio and will be measured on outcomes including gross retention, platform adoption, customer health, and value realization.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you’ll do:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Serve as the primary strategic partner for a portfolio of customers, aligning CreatorIQ’s capabilities to their business goals and driving measurable value.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build trusted, multi-threaded relationships across customer organizations, from day-to-day users to executive stakeholders.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive platform adoption and customer success by understanding each customer’s strategy, analyzing engagement, and identifying opportunities to increase value.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead strategic engagements including success planning, business reviews, roadmap discussions, and in-person meetings as appropriate.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own customer health and retention across your portfolio, proactively identifying risk and coordinating action plans to support long-term success.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Maintain strategic account plans that capture customer goals, key stakeholders, adoption opportunities, risks, and growth opportunities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner cross-functionally with Sales, Implementation, Services, Support, and Product to deliver a cohesive customer experience and resolve needs effectively.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Act as the voice of the customer internally while staying current on CreatorIQ capabilities and industry trends to bring relevant insights and best practices to customers.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Who you are and what you’ll need for this position:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Passionate about creator and influencer marketing, social media, and helping customers build successful programs.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">3+ years of experience in a strategic customer-facing role, ideally within influencer marketing, an agency, brand, SaaS, or marketing technology environment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven ability to manage toward business KPIs, retention goals, customer health, and customer advocacy metrics.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Skilled at navigating customer organizations and building relationships across multiple levels, from daily users to executive sponsors.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortable translating customer goals into actionable success strategies and measurable outcomes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Able to use customer, adoption, and performance data to identify risk, uncover opportunities, and tell compelling stories.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong strategic thinker who can also manage the day-to-day execution and follow-through required to move customer initiatives forward.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Confident leading structured customer engagements including success planning, business reviews, executive conversations, and roadmap discussions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Highly organized and proactive, with the ability to effectively prioritize and manage a portfolio of customers with varying needs and levels of complexity.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Curious, solutions-oriented, and comfortable navigating ambiguity in a fast-paced, evolving environment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Collaborative and experienced working cross-functionally with teams such as Implementation, Support, Product, Services, Insights, and Sales.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortable with customer success and productivity tools such as Salesforce, Google Workspace, Zoom, Slack, Notion, Jira, or similar platforms.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Confidence can sometimes hold us back from applying for a job. But we'll let you in on a secret: there's no such thing as a 'perfect' candidate. Have 50% of the criteria? Excited about this opportunity? Passionate about what we do at CreatorIQ? Please apply! CreatorIQ is a place where everyone can grow.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you will get from us:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">People: work with talented, collaborative, and friendly people who love what they do.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Guidance: utilize our learning platform to fully get the training and tools you’ll need to become successful here from your first day with us.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work/life harmony: 25 days vacation, floating and set holidays, wellness allowance, and paid parental leave.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Stock options as part of our equity-sharing program.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Healthcare coverage, encompassing mental health, physical therapies, dental, vision, cancer coverage, and more.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comprehensive perks program providing stipends for wellness, cell phone and internet, home office setup, mental wellness, professional development, plus occasional company-funded meal opportunities throughout the year.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Who we are:</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">CreatorIQ is the operating system for creator-led growth. Trusted by more than 1,300 global brands and agencies—including Burson, Delta Air Lines, Google, LVMH, Nestlé, and Sephora—CreatorIQ unifies creator marketing across paid, owned, earned, commerce, and community into one seamless, enterprise-grade ecosystem. With industry-leading intelligence infrastructure, rigorous compliance and security standards, and integrations with Meta, Snapchat, TikTok, YouTube, and more, CreatorIQ empowers brands and agencies to harness the creator economy as a strategic growth engine. CreatorIQ is a global company headquartered in Los Angeles with offices in Austin, New York, San Francisco, London, Manila, and Warsaw. Learn more at<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://www.creatoriq.com"><u> www.creatoriq.com</u></a> and follow us on<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/creatoriq"><u> LinkedIn</u></a> and<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.instagram.com/creatoriq"><u> Instagram</u></a>.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At CreatorIQ, we believe that diversity is the key to unlocking our full potential. We are committed to fostering an inclusive, equitable, and empowering work environment where everyone can thrive, regardless of race, ethnicity, gender, sexual orientation, age, religion, disability, or any other characteristic that makes us unique. By embracing our core values of being intentional, pursuing excellence every day, embracing the journey together, being a good human, and staying focused on what’s important, we create an atmosphere that promotes collaboration and growth. Join us to celebrate differences, innovate together, and be a part of a business that is disrupting the marketing industry.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Compensation, Benefits and Beyond:</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We understand that a comprehensive benefits package plays a significant role in your overall compensation. To gain more insight into the various components of our total compensation,<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://creatoriq.notion.site/What-you-ll-get-from-us-at-CreatorIQ-UK-127f0588631b4f129bde798ee0e32989?pvs=4"> <u>we invite you to review our benefits and perks</u></a>.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>AI Transparency Notice</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>We may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to support parts of the hiring process, such as reviewing applications and note taking during interviews. These tools assist our recruitment team but do not replace human judgment. Final hiring decisions are ultimately made by humans. If you would like more information about how your data is processed, please refer to our </em><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://creatoriq.notion.site/Global-Candidate-Privacy-Notice-1f29bdd3fbd98069a1e2eb6acefb3acf"><em>Global Candidate Privacy Notice</em></a><em>.</em></p><hr><p>Compensation: £57K – £74K • Offers Equity • Offers Bonus</p><ul><li> • £57K – £74K • Offers Equity • Offers Bonus</li></ul><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/creatoriq/customer-success-partner-emea-paris-37428","tags":["Customer Experience"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Paris","created_at":1791142809},{"slug":"key-account-manager-automotive-france-329137","company_name":"Hongfa Europe Gmbh","title":"Key Account Manager Automotive France (m/f/d)","description":"<br><strong>Your role</strong><p><p style="margin-right:1.7pt;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;"><strong>Strategic Account Management &amp; Business Development</strong></p><ul style="list-style-type:disc;margin-left:5.75px;"><li><strong>Relationship:</strong> Establish, navigate, and maintain high-level relationships within leading French OEMs and Tier 1 suppliers across the French region, Central Europe, and beyond.</li><li>Identify key stakeholders and decision-makers (R&amp;D, Procurement, Quality) to communicate the technical and commercial advantages of Hongfa’s product portfolio.</li><li><strong>Strategy Implementation:</strong> Develop and execute comprehensive account strategies in collaboration with the Sales Management to exceed annual sales targets and long-term KPIs.</li><li><strong>Deal Leadership:</strong> Lead the entire sales cycle—from initial hunting and business development to the final closing of major contracts and platform wins.</li></ul><p style="margin-top:0cm;margin-right:1.7pt;margin-bottom:0.0001pt;margin-left:18pt;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;"><strong>Market Intelligence &amp; Planning</strong></p><ul style="list-style-type:disc;margin-left:5.75px;"><li><strong>Market Analysis:</strong> Continuously monitor market trends, competitor activities, and technological shifts to identify new project opportunities and "blue ocean" potentials.</li><li><strong>Sales Operations:</strong> Ensure data integrity by permanently maintaining CRM and SAP systems, including monthly forecast updates, budget planning, and project tracking.</li><li><strong>Reporting:</strong> Deliver regular, insightful reports on sales performance, pipeline health, and strategic milestones to the executive management.</li></ul><p style="margin-right:1.7pt;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;"><span style="font-size:11px;line-height:115%;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0cm;margin-right:1.7pt;margin-bottom:0.0001pt;margin-left:15.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;"><strong>Project &amp; Acquisition Leadership</strong></p><ul style="list-style-type:disc;margin-left:5.75px;"><li><strong>Strategic Acquisition ("Hunting"):</strong> Proactively identify and win new business opportunities, focusing on high-volume platforms and strategic programs.</li><li><strong>RFQ Management:</strong> Orchestrate strategic RFQs for new platforms. This includes defining the quotation strategy, coordinating commercial/legal documentation, and aligning with Department Leaders and the Program Management team.</li><li><strong>Commercial Negotiation:</strong> Define final negotiation strategies and secure commercial commitments. Negotiate at the management level with both the customer and Hongfa’s internal BUs.</li><li><strong>Life-Cycle Involvement:</strong> Own the strategic relationship during the early acquisition phase and ensure a seamless handover/collaboration with Program Managers.</li></ul><p style="margin-top:0cm;margin-right:1.7pt;margin-bottom:0.0001pt;margin-left:15.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;"><span style="font-size:11px;line-height:115%;"> </span></p><p style="margin-right:1.7pt;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;"><strong> </strong></p><ul style="list-style-type:disc;margin-left:5.75px;"><li><strong>Representation &amp; Escalation Management</strong></li><li><strong>Management Interaction:</strong> Represent the account in strategic meetings, including Year-End Reviews, PBD-Analysis, and "Gate" reviews.</li><li><strong>Escalation Lead:</strong> Act as the primary point of contact for high-level escalations (e.g., Quality/H-ELP issues) to ensure swift resolution and maintain customer trust.</li><li><strong>Global Mobility:</strong> Travel regularly to customers, international trade fairs, and production facilities to strengthen the partnership and HFE’s brand presence.</li></ul></p><br><strong>Your strengths</strong><p><ul style="list-style-type:disc;margin-left:5.85px;"><li><a href="https://www.topuniversities.com/courses/engineering-electrical-electronic/guide"><span>Strong</span></a> technical skills achieved through a bachelor degree in engineering or similar technical background</li><li>More than 5 years professional experience</li><li>Fluent French and English, other language skills would be an advantag</li><li>International work experience</li><li>Intercultural skills, Presentation and Management skills</li><li>Ability to manage the complex selling process, consisting of engagement at all levels, from engineering &amp; technical teams to senior management - including an understanding of when and why</li><li>Natural leader by personality - not by Organisation chart</li><li>Good negotiation skills</li><li>Team player and strong communicator</li><li>Excellent interpersonal skills</li><li>Enthusiastic</li><li>High level of energy and dynamic, self-driven personality</li><li>Self-motivation, confident</li><li>Ability to set and achieve goals</li><li><span style="font-size:13px;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;">Good sense of humour</span></li></ul></p><br><strong>Here's what you can look forward to</strong><p><span style="color:rgb(31,31,31);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji';font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);display:inline;">Become part of an internationally active organization and make an active contribution to the development of the company with your ideas and experience. We offer a corporate culture in which it is a pleasure to contribute ideas, energy and initiative. You can expect exciting tasks, performance-related pay, regulated working hours/flexitime and a pleasant working atmosphere. In addition, well-equipped workplaces with the appropriate technical equipment are a matter of course for us.</span><br style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;color:rgb(31,31,31);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji';font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);"><br style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;color:rgb(31,31,31);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji';font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);"><span style="color:rgb(31,31,31);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji';font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);display:inline;">What we offer:</span><br style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;color:rgb(31,31,31);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji';font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);"><ul style="border:0px solid;color:rgb(31,31,31);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji';font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);"><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;">Company bonus (voluntary)</li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;">40 hours per week</li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;">30 days’ annual leave</li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;">1 day’s special leave for every 5 years’ service</li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;">Opportunities for further training</li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;">Celebration of work anniversaries, birthdays, etc. (including vouchers)</li></ul><span style="color:rgb(31,31,31);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji';font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);display:inline;">In addition to our general conditions</span><br style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;color:rgb(31,31,31);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji';font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);"><ul style="border:0px solid;color:rgb(31,31,31);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji';font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);"><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;">A corporate culture where it’s enjoyable to contribute ideas, energy and initiative</li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;">A rapidly growing company offering scope for creativity</li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;">Exciting roles and performance-related pay</li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;">An international working environment with exciting projects</li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;">A pleasant working atmosphere and supportive teams</li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;">Company events</li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;">Structured, role-specific and tailor-made onboarding plans</li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;">Well-equipped workstations with modern technical equipment</li></ul></p><br><strong>Let’s talk - Your contact person</strong><p>Jason Rogowski - HR Business Partner</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/hongfa-europe-gmbh/key-account-manager-automotive-france-329137","tags":["Sales","Automotive","Key Account Manager","Sales France","Relay","Technical Sales","Electrical Engineering"],"job_types":["Experienced","Permanent","Full time"],"location":"FR","created_at":1791140997},{"slug":"enterprise-account-executive-dutch-speaking-paris-90923","company_name":"Algolia","title":"Enterprise Account Executive - Dutch Speaking","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_8220454926977230902gmail-docs-internal-guid-9a9f34f4-7fff-014a-c97c-98ca90610a47&quot;&gt;Algolia is the retrieval intelligence layer that turns intent into trusted, decision-grade outcomes. Powering more than 1.7 trillion queries a year for over 18,000 customers with millisecond latency and 99.999% reliability, we are the recognized leader for Search and Product Discovery by top industry analyst firms. The Algolia platform turns a company&#39;s products, content, and business rules into data that humans, applications and AI agents can act upon. The result is trusted customer experiences with stronger conversions for measurable business impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Algolia, we are on a mission to help businesses connect their end-users with what matters most, in milliseconds. As the leader in AI-powered Search and Discovery, we’re driving the next frontier of digital experiences - where generative AI, adaptive relevance, and agentic workflows help enterprises move beyond traditional search into truly intelligent, self-optimising discovery at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Enterprise Account Executive, you’ll play a pivotal role in bringing these innovations to life for Global 2000 organisations. You won’t just sell a product - you’ll guide customers through a transformation where algorithms act as strategic copilots, delivering contextual recommendations, predictive experiences, and AI-assisted user journeys that improve engagement and business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own complex, high-impact relationships, lead multi-stakeholder buying cycles, and work cross-functionally to articulate the value of AI-first search, agentic automation, and composable architecture. This role demands strategic instincts, a consultative mindset, and the ability to translate AI innovation into measurable business value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a builder, a challenger, and a trusted advisor. You thrive in dynamic environments and know how to position Algolia as a key enabler of AI-driven digital transformation - not just another line item in a stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR ROLE WILL CONSIST OF:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning, managing, and accelerating an enterprise pipeline&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving inbound and outbound opportunities through complex, multi-threaded sales cycles to closed-won&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positioning Algolia’s generative AI and agentic capabilities to executives and technical champions - showing how real-time relevance, predictive personalisation, and autonomous search assistants deliver business value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing territory and account strategies across your portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expanding existing accounts by identifying opportunities for strategic and commercial growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generating new enterprise projects by self-sourcing high-value meetings, networking within communities, and leveraging partner ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering with Solutions Engineering to build bespoke demos, proofs-of-value, and ROI analyses that highlight impact beyond traditional search metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecasting accurately with disciplined methodologies (MEDDPICC) and a deep understanding of decision drivers and buyer risk profiles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating cross-functionally (SDRs, Solutions Engineers, Customer Success, Legal, Marketing, Partners) to align execution with business outcomes and long-term enterprise value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOU MIGHT BE A FIT IF YOU HAVE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in Dutch and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of enterprise SaaS sales experience, with a strong track record of closing complex deals - especially in digital transformation, AI/ML, or search/commerce domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep interest in generative AI, machine learning-enabled customer experiences, and how agentic systems unlock competitive advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success selling into large, multi-department organisations with complex evaluation criteria and dispersed stakeholder influence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with selling adjacent solutions or ability to quickly learn technical differentiation and articulate it to technical and executive stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong outbound sales capability, modern prospecting skills, and comfort leading with insight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with strategic partners (consultancies, SIs, ISVs) to co-build opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling platforms with usage-based pricing, AI-first capabilities, or composable architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of how generative models and agentic tools are used in commerce, discovery, and digital engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort discussing technical architecture and AI relevance with technical decision makers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A curious, growth-oriented approach with the ability to balance strategic vision and execution rigor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for building new ground - especially where cutting-edge AI meets real business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Algolia does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex, age, national origin, military status, veteran status, disability status, sexual orientation, gender identity, genetic information, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The annual total cash compensation range (base salary and commission) for this role reflects market pay data within this location. The exact compensation offered for this role may vary depending on specific location and job-related knowledge, technical skills, and experience; and is only one part of our Total Rewards philosophy to compensate and recognize employees for their work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;On-Target Earnings Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€172.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€200.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FLEXIBLE WORKPLACE STRATEGY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Algolia’s flexible workplace model is designed to empower all Algolians to fulfill our mission to power search and discovery with ease. We place an emphasis on an individual’s impact, contribution, and output, over their physical location. Algolia is a high-trust environment and many of our team members have the autonomy to choose where they want to work and when.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a global presence with offices in Paris, NYC, London, Sydney and Bucharest, however we also offer many of our team members the option to work remotely either as fully remote or hybrid-remote employees.&lt;strong&gt; Positions listed as &quot;Remote&quot; are only available for remote work within the specified country. Positions listed within a specific city are only available in that location - depending on the role it may be available with either a hybrid-remote or in-office schedule.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE’RE LOOKING FOR SOMEONE WHO CAN LIVE OUR VALUES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
