&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our open positions may appear on third-party job boards, but the &lt;strong&gt;best way to apply safely&lt;/strong&gt; is directly through our &lt;strong&gt;careers page&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All genuine communication from Algolia will come from an ----- email address. If you receive an email from someone claiming to work at Algolia who does not have an ----- email address, please do not respond or share any personal information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’ll &lt;strong&gt;never ask for payments, purchases, or financial details&lt;/strong&gt; during the hiring process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;READY TO APPLY?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you share our values and our enthusiasm for building the world’s best search &amp;amp; discovery technology, we’d love to review your application!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/algolia/enterprise-account-executive-dutch-speaking-paris-90923","tags":["Direct Sales"],"job_types":[],"location":"Paris","created_at":1791132906},{"slug":"ai-engineer-paris-365273","company_name":"Lemrock","title":"AI Engineer","description":"<h2>Who we are</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lemrock builds the infrastructure of agentic commerce.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Tomorrow, consumers won't just buy on e-commerce websites. They will discover, compare and purchase directly inside conversational AI interfaces like ChatGPT, Perplexity, and a growing long tail of specialized AI assistants.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">For brands, this is a major shift: if they are not present in these environments, they become invisible.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our mission: enable any brand to exist, sell and distribute in this new channel.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We raised a €7M seed round (the first in Europe on this market), with Jean-Baptiste Rudelle, founder of Criteo, on our board, and the Bpifrance DeepTech label.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Today, Lemrock is already:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">100M+ conversations per month</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">150+ brand clients</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">a $100B market structuring at high speed</p></li></ul><h2>Context</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll join a tight-knit team with high product standards and <strong>direct access to production deployment</strong>: our models are tested in real-world conditions, with several million users each month, with very short cycles between prototyping, integration and deployment.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">In this context, you'll work on the <strong>next generation of agentic and recommendation systems</strong>: building the pipelines, agents, and models that sit at the core of our product.</p><h2>Your Mission</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Your goal is to <strong>build and scale the agentic infrastructure that powers Lemrock's commerce intelligence</strong>: turning raw signals into automated, self-improving systems at production scale.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Concretely, you will:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Analyze large-scale conversational interaction datasets</strong> (100M+ events/month) to uncover behavioral patterns, intent signals, and performance drivers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Design and deploy agentic pipelines end-to-end</strong>, from data ingestion and enrichment to model orchestration, monitoring, and continuous improvement, integrated into systems exposed to millions of requests daily.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Build autonomous agents</strong> that keep our knowledge infrastructure accurate and current.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Translate insights into iteration loops in production</strong>, by updating, fine-tuning, and improving our existing recommendation and ranking algorithms with tight constraints on latency, robustness, and business outcomes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Design and train new recommendation models from scratch</strong> when needed, with a focus on scalability, evaluation rigor, and deployability in real-world traffic.</p></li></ul><h2>Candidate Profile</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong academic background (MVA, ENS, X, Central…)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">2+ years of experience in AI, Agentic Systems, ML / Deep Learning, statistics or NLP</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience prototyping and deploying AI models into production</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with production systems (APIs, monitoring, optimization)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong interest in LLMs, recommendation and conversational systems: building agentic pipelines, agent orchestration, fine-tuning</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortable with AI coding tools (Claude Code, Cursor)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Thrives in ambiguity and 0-to-1 environments</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluent in English; French is a plus</p></li></ul><h2>Tech Stack</h2><h3>ML/AI (required)</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Agentic frameworks (e.g., Langchain) and/or native SDKs like OpenAI/Anthropic</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Observability and evaluation for LLM/agent workflows</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Vector search, scoring, prompting, LLM orchestration</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hybrid recommender systems, causal inference, probabilistic models</p></li></ul><h3>Bonus (appreciated but not required)</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">TypeScript</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Engineering: Docker, GCP, PostgreSQL, Redis, Vector DBs, PostHog</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">CI/CD</p></li></ul><h2>Why Join Us</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Join a company in <strong>early breakout mode</strong>, already generating revenue, with a clear technological edge and strong financial backing to fuel its growth</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work directly with an <strong>experienced team</strong>: two repeat YC founders who've scaled product &amp; tech before, a former strategy/innovation director (10 years in the sector), and ex-strategy consultants (McKinsey QuantumBlack, BCG)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Be part of the <strong>next structural shift of the web</strong>: agentic interfaces</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own <strong>mission-critical topics</strong>, grow fast, and shape the company's future trajectory</p></li></ul><h2>Package</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Competitive salary disclosed during the interview process.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/lemrock/ai-engineer-paris-365273","tags":["Engineering"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Paris (hybrid)","created_at":1791132011},{"slug":"remote-content-editor-133934","company_name":"Higgsfield","title":"Content Editor","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Why work at Higgsfield AI?</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Higgsfield AI is the fastest-scaling generative AI company in history, hitting $700M in annual revenue run rate, 30M+ users worldwide, 6M+ generations per day, and powering 390 of Fortune 500 brands.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We write a lot, and it's read by millions of people around the world. Our content team is already strong, and now we want to make it stronger. You'll be the native voice of the brand: everything our users read will go through you.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you will work on</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Reviewing and editing the team's copy across the blog, Help Center, changelog, Creator Hub, case studies, PR and news, newsletters, product updates, and UI text;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fact-checking every piece before it ships: checking model and feature names against the product;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Keeping facts consistent across every surface, so the same number reads the same in the blog, Help Center, landing pages, and press releases;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Shaping content for AI answers: a direct answer up front, question-based headings, useful FAQs, and internal links;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Keeping the writing alive and human, with no traces of AI or template-speak;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Working on tone, rhythm and clarity, not just fixing grammar;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Writing your own pieces too, including editorial work like our Inside Higgsfield series;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Holding one consistent brand voice across everything we publish.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Your must haves</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">English as your native language;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A strong background in editing and writing, with a portfolio to show for it;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">An instinct for style, tone and rhythm. You feel when a sentence works and when it doesn't;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The ability to explain your edits and how they make the text stronger. "It sounds better" is a start, not an answer;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">An owner mindset: you see what could be better, and you make it happen;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfort with startup pace. We move fast, ship weekly, and the writing has to keep up.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Nice to have</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience editing for a tech, SaaS or AI product;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience building or maintaining a style guide or brand voice;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Familiarity with the GenAI landscape and the tools creators actually use;</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>The deal</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Competitive salary in USD;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fully remote position;</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Access to Higgsfield products and the AI tools we use internally;</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Full-time position with high ownership and growth potential.</p></li></ul><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/higgsfield/remote-content-editor-133934","tags":["Customer Experience"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Remote","created_at":1791132009},{"slug":"team-lead-website-paris-55620","company_name":"Pennylane SAS","title":"Team Lead Website","description":"<h2><strong>Why this role exists ?</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">At Pennylane, our website is a key engine for acquisition and conversion, transforming traffic from SEO, paid acquisition, media, and partnerships into demo bookings and self-sign-ups.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">With over <strong>450,000 monthly visits</strong>, our website already brings together conversion, product management, engineering, and tracking. We are seeking a <strong>Team Lead Website</strong> to provide clear leadership, structure the team, and scale our conversion performance.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">Reporting to the Head of Growth, you will lead a multidisciplinary squad and ensure the website’s speed, quality, and business impact.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2><strong>🌍 What is Pennylane?</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Pennylane is one of France’s leading fintech unicorns, building the financial and accounting operating system for European SMEs and accounting firms.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">Founded in 2020, we help business owners make better decisions and empower accountants to focus on advising clients.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>A few figures illustrating our scale and ambition:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">💻 Over <strong>1.3 million SMEs</strong> already work with Pennylane</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">🤝 More than <strong>7,000 accounting firms</strong> use our platform</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Over <strong>1,100 Pennylaners</strong> from more than 25 nationalities</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">💰 More than <strong>€400 million raised</strong> since launch</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">🌍 Remote-friendly, international culture expanding across Europe</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2>What You’ll Do</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will lead our Website squad and collaborate closely with Growth, Product, Engineering, Sales, Demand Gen, Data, Brand, and Automation teams.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h3>Lead and Grow the Website Squad</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Set clear roles, objectives, and rituals</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Manage and develop multidisciplinary profiles across conversion, product, and engineering</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Foster growth in autonomy and seniority</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Integrate AI into daily work to accelerate processes (e.g., backlog management, landing-page creation)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Recruit additional talent as needed</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h3>Drive Conversion</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Define and prioritize initiatives that improve demo bookings and self-sign-ups</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Frame, challenge, and unblock projects while empowering owners</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Monitor conversion KPIs and ensure focus on measurable business impact</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Share results and learnings with Growth, Sales, and Product teams</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h3>Scale Experimentation</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Enhance the pace and quality of our A/B testing program</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Structure identification, prioritization, design, and analysis of hypotheses</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ensure statistical rigor and clear decision-making from experiments</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Make experimentation a consistent driver of website performance</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h3>Deliver Strategic Projects</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead brand redesigns and update commercial messaging</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support new product launches with self-sign-up journeys</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Prepare the website for international expansion</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Coordinate stakeholders, manage dependencies, and handle competing priorities</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h3>Protect Technical and Data Foundations</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with Engineering to ensure website performance, reliability, and security</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own tracking plan and conversion data quality</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Align Growth and Data teams on trusted metrics and reporting</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2>What You Bring</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>7–10 years of experience</strong> in Growth, Conversion, or Product, including people-management</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong expertise in <strong>CRO and/or product management for a high-traffic website</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven track record in delivering measurable conversion improvements</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience managing and developing multidisciplinary teams</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Deep understanding of experimentation and A/B testing methodologies</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to collaborate with Engineering on performance, tracking, and security (coding not required)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience leading complex projects with multiple business and technical stakeholders</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong leadership, communication, and prioritization skills</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hands-on experience using AI to enhance personal and team operations</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluent <strong>English</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in <strong>B2B SaaS, marketplaces, self-sign-up models, or fast-growing e-commerce</strong> (plus), along with tracking and analytics knowledge</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2>🛠️ Tools and Environment</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will work with experimentation, tracking, and analytics tools such as <strong>AB Tasty, GA4, GTM, and Amplitude</strong> and use AI to boost squad operations and execution.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2>What You Can Expect</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ownership of a strategic website attracting over