solve member and lab partner inquiries via chat and phone, delivering high-touch support from day one.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Internal Product Mastery:</strong> Act as our expert power user, testing our internal OS and advocating for tool improvements that boost operational efficiency.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>NPS &amp; Proactive Care:</strong> Design proactive care initiatives to ensure member satisfaction remains consistently best-in-class.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>Post-Ramp: Team Scale &amp; Process</em></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Team Scaling &amp; Playbooks:</strong> Build, mentor, and lead a growing support team while writing our core SOPs, escalation pathways, and training guides.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Cross-Functional Feedback:</strong> Turn daily support interactions into structured insights that directly inform product roadmap decisions.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2><strong>About you</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’re passionate about the future of human health and want your work to help people stay healthy for longer. You move quickly from idea to execution, take full ownership of what you build, and work best with talented people who care as much as you do.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You thrive in fast‑moving environments, learn by doing, and value feedback as a way to continuously improve. You use AI the way others use a calculator: naturally, to go faster and think bigger.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2><strong>You’ll fit in well if</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Experience:</strong> 2+ years in high-volume B2C customer care or support, with a track record of mentoring peers and a readiness to step into your first formal lead role.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Bilingual Skills:</strong> Fluent in both English and French (written and spoken).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>People-First Energy:</strong> You bring genuine warmth, high empathy, and enthusiasm to every interaction, turning routine support into remarkable member experiences.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Phone-First Instinct:</strong> You default to picking up the phone whenever a complex issue calls for a personal touch.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Rigorous Precision:</strong> Exceptional attention to detail with zero tolerance for misquotes, incorrect details, or operational errors.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>Nice to have</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Regulated Industry Experience:</strong> Prior background in healthtech, fintech, or another high-compliance consumer space where accuracy is critical.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Startup Mindset:</strong> Thrives in early-stage environments with high autonomy, rapid execution, and clear communication.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Modern Tooling:</strong> Practical experience using AI tools to streamline workflows and boost support efficiency.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2><strong>The process</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Intro call, culture &amp; role fit (20 min)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Case study interview (30-60 min)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Deep dive and team chat, on-site (2 hours)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Reference calls</p></li></ul><h2></h2><h2><strong>How we work</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We work together from our Paris hub. We’re passionate about what we’re building and believe the fastest way to create something exceptional is side by side. We’re open to relocation support for the