eight:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2><strong>The process</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Intro call, culture &amp; role fit (20 min)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Case study interview (30-60 min)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Deep dive and team chat, on-site (2 hours)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Reference calls</p></li></ul><h2></h2><h2><strong>How we work</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We work together from our Paris hub. We’re passionate about what we’re building and believe the fastest way to create something exceptional is side by side. We’re open to relocation support for the right individuals, and we welcome missionaries who travel to work with us in Paris on a regular basis.</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Rigor without ego:</strong> Audits, science, and code all deserve the same high bar.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Radical ownership:</strong> Feedback loops are short; everyone contributes to building the best version of Lucis.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Velocity over perfection:</strong> We ship daily and prefer a good decision today over a perfect one next week.</p></li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/lucis/customer-care-specialist-paris-309097","tags":["Operations"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Paris","created_at":1791132007},{"slug":"developpeur-full-stack-js-lyon-212212","company_name":"Arkane Cloud","title":"Développeur Full Stack JS","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>Demain, notre console recevra des milliards de requêtes. Votre mission : faire en sorte qu’elle tienne, et qu’elle reste rapide. Arkane Cloud crée un poste de Développeur Full Stack, à 80 % back-end, pour bâtir une plateforme taillée