 to high-stakes data security. We are in a hyper-growth phase. You will have a seat at the table in shaping our market approach and the opportunity to drive massive revenue in the industry's most relevant sector.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>The Ideal Candidate You are a strategic closer with a sales experience within the AI, Machine Learning, or Data Services landscape. You don’t just sell "services"—you sell a vision of digital transformation. You possess the technical gravitas to speak with Chief Data Officers and AI Researchers, and the commercial acumen to navigate complex procurement cycles at the highest levels.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>Key position responsibilities:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Drive Revenue: Systematically develop high-value accounts, exceeding annual sales targets and expanding TransPerfect’s AI footprint.</p></li><li><p>Consultative Leadership: Act as a subject matter expert, guiding clients through the complexities of AI data preparation and the implementation of bespoke AI workflows.</p></li><li><p>Collaborate for Success: Partner with our world-class Solutions Architects and Project Managers to ensure the seamless transition from "Closed-Won" to high-quality delivery.</p></li></ul> <br> <p style="text-align:start;"><strong>Essential skills required:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Commit to a high level of integrity and service</p></li><li><p>Deliver quality work</p></li><li><p>Service focused with a desire to exceed clients’ expectations</p></li><li><p>Owning your performance and taking responsibility</p></li><li><p>Multitask and work with a sense of urgency in a fast-paced environment</p></li><li><p>Commit to always treating everyone (from clients to co-workers to vendors to business partners) with the ultimate level of respect</p></li><li><p>Work well in a team with people from a variety of different backgrounds and cultures</p></li><li><p>Build and maintain strategic relationships with clients and co-workers</p></li><li><p>Celebrate diversity and embrace new ideas and differing perspectives</p></li><li><p>Be financially responsible and make sound financial decisions</p></li><li><p>Take active measures to achieve results and solve problems</p></li></ul><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Required&nbsp;Experience:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Industry Expertise: proven success in enterprise-level sales, with a deep understanding of the AI/ML ecosystem.</p></li><li><p>The Closer Mentality: A documented track record of meeting and exceeding quotas.</p></li><li><p>Strategic Communication: Ability to articulate complex technical concepts to non-technical stakeholders and executive leadership.</p></li><li><p>Entrepreneurial Drive: A self-starter who excels in an autonomous environment and possesses the grit required to win in a competitive market.</p></li></ul><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><em>TransPerfect values equal opportunities. Applicants are therefore considered regardless of their age, gender, race, ethnic origin, skin colour, religion, belief, descent, genes, disabilities, sexual orientation, marital status or other characteristics worthy of protection. Applicants with disabilities are welcome and encouraged. If you experience any issues with your application process or require assistance please contact ----- style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>By applying, I confirm I have read and accept TransPerfect's Privacy Policy: https://www.transperfect.com/about/data-privacy-recruiting</strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/transperfect/director-of-strategic-accounts-paris-394914","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Paris, Île-de-France, France","created_at":1791131426},{"slug":"director-business-development-paris-317367","company_name":"TransPerfect","title":"Director, Business Development","description":"<p class="MsoNormal"><u><span style="color:#424242">About TransPerfect</span></u></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">TransPerfect is the world's largest privately held provider of language services and technology solutions. With over 100 offices globally and more than 5,000 full-time employees, we work with the world's leading organisations across Legal, Corporate, Life Sciences, Financial, and Creative sectors to help them communicate, operate, and grow across languages, cultures, and markets.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Following our acquisition of The Mill — one of the world's most acclaimed creative studios — TransPerfect now offers an expanded suite of creative production services, including Artistic Direction, VFX, and Motion Design, serving luxury, fashion, beauty, and lifestyle brands globally.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><u><span style="color:#424242">Role Overview</span></u></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">We are looking for a Director of Business Development to join our Corporate vertical in France. This is a pure new business hunter role — your mission is to identify, prospect, and close net new accounts across TransPerfect's full portfolio of services.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">You will be selling into mid-to-large corporate accounts across a broad range of industries, with a particular focus on sectors where TransPerfect's expanded capabilities — including creative production via The Mill — create strong differentiation and cross-sell opportunity.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">This role is ideal for a commercially driven professional who combines structured B2B sales discipline with genuine curiosity about creative, digital, and linguistic services.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><u><span style="color:#424242">What You Will Sell</span></u></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">You will represent TransPerfect's full Corporate service portfolio, including:</span></p><ul><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Translation &amp; Localisation** — documents, marketing, legal, technical, and digital content</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Interpretation** — simultaneous, consecutive, remote (RSI)</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Technology &amp; AI Solutions** — GlobalLink TMS, MT/MTPE, AI-powered workflows</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Digital &amp; Multimedia** — subtitling, dubbing, voice-over, e-learning localisation</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Creative Production (The Mill)** — Artistic Direction, VFX, Motion Design for luxury, fashion, beauty, and lifestyle brands</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Globalisation Consulting** — content strategy, workflow optimisation, language asset management</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><u><span style="color:#424242">Key Responsibilities</span></u></p><ul><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Build and manage a pipeline of net new business across the French and European corporate market</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Identify and engage key decision-makers — CMOs, Heads of Communication, Procurement Directors, Creative Directors, and Heads of Production</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Develop tailored pitches and proposals that draw on the full breadth of TransPerfect's service offering, including creative capabilities</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Lead the full sales cycle from prospecting to close, including RFP/RFI responses, commercial negotiation, and contract finalisation</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Collaborate with internal teams (Solutions, Operations, The Mill creative teams) to design compelling, client-specific solutions</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Represent TransPerfect at industry events, trade shows, and networking forums</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Contribute to market intelligence — identify trends, competitor movements, and emerging client needs</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Report pipeline, forecast, and activity accurately</span></p></li></ul> <br> <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Experience</span></p><ul><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Minimum 3–7 years of B2B sales experience, with a strong track record in new business development</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Experience selling , multi-service solutions to corporate clients — ideally in one or more of the following: creative services, digital production, marketing services, SaaS/tech, or professional services</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Proven ability to close six-figure deals and manage multi-stakeholder, long-cycle sales processes</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Exposure to or genuine interest in creative industries (luxury, fashion, beauty, lifestyle, advertising) — a strong differentiator</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Experience navigating large organisations — identifying budget holders, managing procurement processes, and building internal champions</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Skills &amp; Competencies</span></p><ul><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Hunter profile— proactive, autonomous, energised by opening new doors</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Ability to sell both transactional and strategic engagements depending on client maturity</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Strong discovery and consultative selling skills— listens before pitching</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Comfortable discussing technology, AI, and workflow solutions as well as creative services</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Excellent communication and presentation skills in both French and English</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Commercially rigorous — accurate pipeline management, disciplined forecasting</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Languages</span></p><ul><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">French — native or bilingual (essential)</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">English — fluent, business-level (essential)</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Additional languages a plus</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Education</span></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#424242">Degree in **Business, Marketing, Communications, Languages, or a creative discipline** — or equivalent professional experience</span></p></li></ul><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><em>TransPerfect values equal opportunities. Applicants are therefore considered regardless of their age, gender, race, ethnic origin, skin colour, religion, belief, descent, genes, disabilities, sexual orientation, marital status or other characteristics worthy of protection. Applicants with disabilities are welcome and encouraged. If you experience any issues with your application process or require assistance please contact ----- style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>By applying, I confirm I have read and accept TransPerfect's Privacy Policy: https://www.transperfect.com/about/data-privacy-recruiting</strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/transperfect/director-business-development-paris-317367","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":["Entry","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Paris, Île-de-France, France","created_at":1791131426},{"slug":"master-trainer-openai-ai-cloud-partners-h-f-paris-paris-fr-317198","company_name":"Nonplusultra","title":"Master Trainer OpenAI (AI & Cloud Partners) (H/F), Paris","description":"<br><strong>Your mission</strong><p><p>You train the technical teams of strategic cloud partners to build, integrate and support AI applications with confidence. Your audience is solution architects, field engineers, developers, technical consultants and sales engineering teams.</p><p>You take a proven AI curriculum and make it work for cloud partner audiences: real deployment scenarios, partner-specific examples, live troubleshooting. You are the technical face of our client in the room.</p><br><p><strong>Your tasks include:</strong></p><ul><li>Deliver instructor-led bootcamps, technical workshops, train-the-trainer sessions and hands-on labs for cloud partner organisations.</li><li>Adapt core AI training content for partner audiences such as solution architects, field engineers, developers and partner enablement leaders.</li><li>Translate AI capabilities into practical cloud scenarios, reference architectures and customer-facing use cases.</li><li>Lead practical exercises on how to build, integrate, deploy, evaluate and support AI applications in cloud environments.</li><li>Troubleshoot participant issues live, from lab setup and API calls to code samples and implementation questions.</li><li>Work with program leadership and partner enablement stakeholders to refine delivery plans and localise examples.</li><li>Keep delivery quality high across regions, cohorts and groups with different technical maturity.</li><li>Capture recurring knowledge gaps and recommend improvements to content, labs and facilitation guides.</li></ul></p><br><strong>Your profile</strong><p><p>You move comfortably between developer-level detail, cloud architecture context and an executive-friendly explanation. You are energised by teaching complex material and you earn credibility with engineers by knowing your stuff.</p><br><p><strong>Experience &amp; Education</strong></p><ul><li>More than 5 years of professional experience in technical training, developer education, solution architecture, technical consulting, partner engineering, software development or cloud enablement.</li><li>Experience delivering technical workshops, bootcamps, labs or train-the-trainer sessions for professional audiences.</li><li>Strong practical fluency with generative AI, LLM concepts, prompt engineering, APIs, SDKs and modern AI application patterns.</li><li>Hands-on familiarity with cloud platforms and partner environments such as AWS, Google Cloud, Microsoft Azure or Oracle Cloud.</li><li>Fluent English; a second language (French, Spanish or German) is a strong plus.</li><li>Located in or near a major EMEA city with an airport (for example Paris).</li><li>Willingness to travel for partner workshops and regional programs (approx. 25-35%).</li><li>Of advantage: familiarity with Amazon Bedrock (AWS Bedrock).</li><li>Of advantage: experience enabling cloud partners, hyperscalers, systems integrators or partner field organisations.</li><li>Of advantage: experience building hands-on labs, certification pathways or partner academies.</li></ul><p><strong>Skills &amp; Attributes</strong></p><ul><li>Explains cloud and AI concepts clearly to engineers, architects and business stakeholders alike.</li><li>Facilitates live technical labs and solves setup, code and API issues on the spot.</li><li>Strong executive presence and professional conduct with senior partner stakeholders.</li><li>Adapts content and communication style to different proficiency levels, regions and roles.</li><li>Reads, explains and lightly modifies sample code in Python or JavaScript.</li><li>Understands RAG, vector search, AI agents and workflow orchestration well enough to teach them.</li><li>Of advantage: experience with developer relations, sales engineering enablement or solution architect training.</li></ul></p><br><strong>Why us?</strong><p><p>You teach AI to the people who bring it to enterprise customers, with a premium learner experience as the standard.</p><p><strong>Impact:</strong> Your sessions build the technical confidence that drives AI adoption across partner field teams in EMEA.</p><p><strong>Responsibility:</strong> You own the delivery quality of your workshops and represent a leading AI company directly with strategic partners.</p><p><strong>Dynamics:</strong> AI products change fast, and so does your content; you work in a small team that decides quickly.</p><p><strong>Development:</strong> Product training and credentialing are provided, and you grow into a specialist role in a new, high-visibility training program.</p></p><br><strong>Benefits</strong><p><ul><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;">Home office option</li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;">Flexible working hours</li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;">Fitness subsidy</li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;">Apple hardware (laptop &amp; iPhone)</li></ul></p><br><strong>These are the recruiting steps that await you:</strong><p><ol><li><strong>Culture Fit</strong> - Get to know Rike or Kim from our People team. Learn more about nonplusultra and our culture.</li><li><strong>Content &amp; Role Fit Interview</strong> - Go deeper into the role with Matze Schulz and a technical colleague from OpenAI.</li><li><strong>Case Study</strong> - Work through a practical training scenario together with Matze Schulz and a technical colleague from OpenAI.</li></ol></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/nonplusultra/master-trainer-openai-ai-cloud-partners-h-f-paris-paris-fr-317198","tags":["Technical Trainer","Generative AI","Cloud Partner Enablement","Field Training","EMEA","Paris"],"job_types":["Experienced","Permanent","Full time"],"location":"Paris (FR)","created_at":1791130148},{"slug":"director-customer-success-emea-southern-and-central-europe-143953","company_name":"Onestream","title":"Director, Customer Success EMEA (Southern and Central Europe)","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;734&quot; data-end=&quot;1060&quot;&gt;At OneStream, we&#39;re on a mission to empower every Finance organization and professional to exceed their potential. Our global teams span continents, cultures, and time zones, united by a shared purpose as we build the operating system for modern Finance and help organizations move with greater speed, clarity, and confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1065&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;That mission comes to life through our people. Behind every innovation, customer success, and milestone are talented people working together to make a difference. &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130164568 BCX0&quot;&gt;That&#39;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130164568 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130164568 BCX0&quot;&gt;we&#39;re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130164568 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;looking for people who are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130164568 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;bold enough to think big, authentic in how they lead and collaborate, curious about&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130164568 BCX0&quot;&gt;what&#39;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130164568 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;possible, and committed to delivering results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1065&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;Want a closer look before you apply? Explore our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.onestream.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Careers site&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about our people, culture, and benefits.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At OneStream, we&#39;re building the AI Operating System for Modern Finance. As the only enterprise finance platform that unifies financial and operational data, embeds AI, and extends to meet changing business needs, we&#39;re empowering some of the world&#39;s leading organisations to Take Finance Further. We believe finance leaders need more than traditional Corporate Performance Management (CPM) tools. They need a single, intelligent platform that drives productivity, enables better decisions, and delivers measurable business value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director, Customer Success is a vital leadership role responsible for ensuring that every customer within their designated regions becomes a reference and a success. This role leads and develops a high-performing Customer Success organization while overseeing multiple customer portfolios and driving consistent measurable customer outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Senior Director of Customer Success, the Director, Customer Success is accountable for shaping and executing regional customer success strategies to drive adoption, expansion, retention, and long-term satisfaction. As a trusted customer advocate and consultative leader, this individual ensures customers realize meaningful value from their investment across the full lifecycle, from onboarding through ongoing engagement and renewal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aligned with the Regional Sales Leader, the Director, Customer Success provides strong people leadership while maintaining deep visibility into customer health and execution. They partner closely with Sales, Marketing, Professional Services, Product, and Support to align efforts, address evolving customer needs, and continuously improve product utilization and operational efficiency. The Director, Customer Success amplifies the voice of the customer and translates insights into actions that strengthen customer outcomes and the overall customer experience, especially during escalated situations involving different internal teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Primary Duties and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regional Strategy &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development and implementation of regional customer success strategies, ensuring alignment with global objectives and local market needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption, expansion, and retention efforts, leveraging data-driven insights to optimize outcomes across the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategize with CS leadership and Sales RVP across assigned region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver deep and actionable internal QBRs to CS and Sales Leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate commercial acumen by identifying and capitalizing on expansion opportunities, advising on incremental revenue, and securing operational commitments that strengthen customer relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a customer-facing leader, establish and nurture senior and executive-level relationships with key decisionmakers and influencers across the customer base, promoting mutual success and long-term partnership across your region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Portfolio Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee a diverse portfolio of strategic and complex customer accounts, ensuring high satisfaction, reference-ability, and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, maintain, and execute comprehensive account plans, partnering with internal resources to deliver value throughout the customer lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct, mentor, and develop a team of Senior Managers and Customer Success professionals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of excellence, collaboration, and continuous learning, ensuring the team is equipped to deliver outstanding customer experiences and achieve key performance indicators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and coach team in achieving business goals including maintaining a high GRR, increasing NRR, identifying expansions, and driving KPIs including day-to-day activities leading to the main goals and utilizing tools to track communication and updates from Customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk Management &amp;amp; Advocacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and mitigate risks to customer satisfaction, growth, and renewal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the escalation point for complex situations, influencing the teams responsible for resolutions efficiently and advocating for customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Governance &amp;amp; Process Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and refine regional governance programs, including onboarding, success strategy meetings, and regular business reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the execution of key initiatives that help customers realize measurable value from their investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Insights&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and report on regional performance against key metrics to senior leadership, providing actionable insights and recommendations for continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead regional initiatives to enhance team efficiencies, product utilization, and customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote knowledge sharing, mentor new hires, and support professional development across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate the functions of Sales, Marketing, Professional Services, Education, Partner Alliances, Product, Support, Legal, and Operations to address customer needs and drive business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the voice of the customer across all departments and ensure feedback is incorporated into product and service enhancements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Education and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Business, Finance, Information Systems, or a related field; an advanced degree may be considered in lieu of professional experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in a related function with direct customer advocacy and engagement experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 5 years of experience in Customer Success, Consulting, Account Management, or Sales/Pre-Sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 3 years of experience in a leadership role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing complex customer portfolios and C-level executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive background with SaaS applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of corporate finance functions including financial close, planning, budgeting, forecasting, management reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Education and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert knowledge of OneStream platform and offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience with any CPM solution (OneStream, Oracle, SAP, Anaplan, or other).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in CPM/EPM delivery in complex customer landscapes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert product knowledge combined with very strong business or technical expertise is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding project documentation in accordance with OneStream methodology standards and guidelines is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success in identifying and mapping customer organizational structures and bridging turnover at any level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced MS Office skills, especially Excel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge, Skills, and Abilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert networker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leader by example&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent professional coaching skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent professional relationship building skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational and planning skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keen attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep commitment to customer success and continuous delivery of product value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert in developing cases and roadmaps with customers and align strategies to solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal, written, and presentation skills coupled with interpersonal expertise adapted to all levels including executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter who thrives in multi-tasking environments and adapts priorities seamlessly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep technical problem-solving skills with the ability to rapidly resolve issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with enterprise and cloud software spaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert in managing customer engagements to completion with high satisfaction levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supervisory Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manager of a team of regional CS professionals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel Requirement: Willingness to travel up to 30%, depending on customer needs and geography.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join The OneStream Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transparency around corporate structure, salary, and benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core value of customer success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Variety of project work (not industry-specific)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong culture and&amp;nbsp;camaraderie&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multiple training opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
