aining in a relevant field</li><li>Highly tech-savvy: you quickly get up to speed with new tools, platforms, and systems and enjoy optimizing digital processes</li><li>You work at very high speed, have a quick grasp of new topics, and bring strong organizational talent and project management skills</li><li>You have a good eye for aesthetics, design, formatting, and spelling—your outputs look professional and are error-free</li><li>Advanced skills in MS Office (especially Excel and PowerPoint) and Google Workspace; you create visually appealing presentations and documents</li><li>You understand B2B social media and know how to create professional LinkedIn content that drives reach and relevance</li><li>Experience with content management systems, newsletter tools (e.g., Mailchimp, HubSpot), or comparable platforms</li><li>You work independently, reliably, and in a structured way—even when managing multiple tasks in parallel</li><li>Fluent written and spoken German and English; additional languages are a plus</li><li>Based in Switzerland with the appropriate residence and work permits</li></ul></p><br><strong>What we offer</strong><p><br><ul><li><strong>Remote only:</strong><span> </span>Work from wherever you’re most productive—on-site at the client only in exceptional cases; team events approx. once per quarter</li><li><strong>Maximum flexibility:</strong><span> </span>Part-time from 40% (16 hours/week) possible—you set your own working hours</li><li><strong>Responsibility from day one:</strong><span> </span>You are a core part of our team—no hierarchy, short decision paths</li><li><strong>Variety:</strong><span> </span>No two days are alike—you work at the intersection of marketing, HR, and project business and get to know the full spectrum of an HR boutique</li><li><strong>Appreciation:</strong><span> </span>We value you as a team member and as a person—trust, coaching, and honest feedback are part of our culture</li></ul></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbei